OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start in the east, but
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain quickly sweeping
OL,7,Fthrough around dawn, clearing to a
OL,8,Fsunny, breezy day. Feeling less humid
OL,9,Fthan Monday but still warm in the sun.
OL,10,FStrong winds at times, especially for
OL,11,Fexposed coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FWinds easing through the
OL,14,Fevening for a calm night with long
OL,15,Fclear spells. Feeling chilly with
OL,16,Ftemperatures falling to single-digits,
OL,17,Fa marked drop compared to Monday night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
