OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FTomorrow, winds will
OL,6,Fstrengthen again for a breezy day,
OL,7,Fparticularly along exposed coastlines.
OL,8,FLong sunny spells in the morning, then
OL,9,Fmore limited in the afternoon. Another
OL,10,Fmild day.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FBreezy on Thursday with increasing
OL,14,Fcloud. Rain overnight into Friday but
OL,15,Fbecoming dry with sunny spells during
OL,16,Fthe day. Cooler on Saturday with light
OL,17,Fwinds and sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
